<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#0B0D10;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#12151A;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;background:#0B0D10;border-bottom:1px solid #2C3138;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><img src="https://peptrium.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_2644-cropped-300x300.png" width="30" height="30" alt="" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#E6E8EB;">PEPTRIUM</span></td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;color:#7D848D;">So arbeiten wir</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:32px 20px 28px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7D848D;margin-bottom:8px;">AUS DEM LABOR</div><div style="text-align:left;font-size:34px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Vom Labor<br><span style="color:#8E959E;">bis zu dir.</span></div><div style="text-align:left;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin:12px 0 24px;">Was mit jedem Vial passiert, bevor es bei dir ankommt – in 4 Schritten.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="52" valign="top" style="width:52px;padding:0;"><div style="background-color:#3A4048;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2F4F6 0%,#8E959E 35%,#3A4048 60%,#C9CED6 100%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;margin:0 auto;"><div style="width:38px;height:38px;line-height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0D10;color:#FFF;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">1</div></div><div style="width:2px;height:100%;min-height:34px;background:#2C3138;margin:6px auto 0;"></div></td><td valign="top" style="padding:6px 0 18px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Hergestellt & gefriergetrocknet</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:3px;">Jedes Peptid kommt als lyophilisiertes Pulver – stabil und lange haltbar.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="52" valign="top" style="width:52px;padding:0;"><div style="background-color:#3A4048;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2F4F6 0%,#8E959E 35%,#3A4048 60%,#C9CED6 100%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;margin:0 auto;"><div style="width:38px;height:38px;line-height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0D10;color:#FFF;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">2</div></div><div style="width:2px;height:100%;min-height:34px;background:#2C3138;margin:6px auto 0;"></div></td><td valign="top" style="padding:6px 0 18px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Geprüft per HPLC & LC-MS</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:3px;">Reinheit (≥ 99 %) und Identität werden für jede Charge geprüft.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="52" valign="top" style="width:52px;padding:0;"><div style="background-color:#3A4048;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2F4F6 0%,#8E959E 35%,#3A4048 60%,#C9CED6 100%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;margin:0 auto;"><div style="width:38px;height:38px;line-height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0D10;color:#FFF;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">3</div></div><div style="width:2px;height:100%;min-height:34px;background:#2C3138;margin:6px auto 0;"></div></td><td valign="top" style="padding:6px 0 18px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">Neutral verpackt</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:3px;">Ohne Hinweis auf den Inhalt, sicher gepolstert.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="52" valign="top" style="width:52px;padding:0;"><div style="background-color:#3A4048;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2F4F6 0%,#8E959E 35%,#3A4048 60%,#C9CED6 100%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;margin:0 auto;"><div style="width:38px;height:38px;line-height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#0B0D10;color:#FFF;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">4</div></div></td><td valign="top" style="padding:6px 0 0px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#FFF;">In 2 Werktagen bei dir</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#A3A9B1;margin-top:3px;">Versand mit DHL, die Sendungsnummer bekommst du per E-Mail.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 20px 22px;text-align:center;background:#12151A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7D848D;margin-bottom:12px;">DEINE WERKZEUGE</div><a href="https://peptrium.com/peptid-rechner/?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium